<p>Hello,</p>
<p>The <%= @service %> connection for <strong><%= @identity %></strong> ends on <strong><%= @ends_on %></strong>. <%= @service %> sign-ins last 60 days and the house cannot renew them on its own.</p>
<p>To keep residents posting, open <a href="<%= @integrations_url %>">Integrations</a> and connect <%= @service %> again with the same profile. The connection, its residents and its history stay as they are.</p>
<p><%= Setting.instance.site_name %></p>
